{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>由杜如風主持最新旅遊節目《跟風旅行團》播出後即引爆網絡熱話，有觀眾在社交平台發長文質疑其主持風格如同機械人唸對白。面對連串針對外貌與節目內容尖銳指控，這位作風破格資深女主持火速現身親自寫下五字留言強勢反擊。這種不加修飾直接回應瞬間將整個網絡討論推向白熱化階段。</p>\n<h2>網民發文直指《跟風旅行團》表現生硬猶如AI劇</h2>\n<p>焦點旅遊節目《跟風旅行團》帶領觀眾遠赴首爾探索潮流熱點，不過播出約十五分鐘後便在Threads上引發激烈討論。有網民發文形容杜如風在鏡頭前不斷背誦台詞，完全感受不到對當地景點帶有任何情感，甚至反覆說出「I am a strong woman」如同真人表演AI劇。除了批評對白刺耳與步調過於急促，亦有人將矛頭指向女主持外貌，直指昔日人氣旅遊KOL如今面容變得僵硬猶如木頭人，更有人嫌棄節目介紹景點屬於已經過時資訊。</p>\n<h2>杜如風無懼負評親身以霸氣五字留言強勢反擊</h2>\n<p>面對鋪天蓋地衝擊與質疑聲音，這位被外界封為世界級港女依然保持強大心理質素，毫不退縮地直接在該則批評帖文下方霸氣回覆。她僅以「冇人逼你睇！」五個字作正面反擊，完全展現出其率直且懶理世俗眼光破格真性情。沒有冗長公關辭令或情緒化爭辯，這種乾淨俐落處理方式不但化解尷尬場面，更將其強烈個人特色表露無遺，瞬間成為整個社交平台焦點所在。</p>\n<h2>忠實擁躉細數杜如風十多年來破格獨特主持風格</h2>\n<p>回顧杜如風過去逾十年演藝軌跡，無論是早期《流行東京》還是《流行首爾》，她向來貫徹這種隨性且毫不造作獨有路線。這次爆發討論後，大批陪伴她成長忠實支持者隨即湧入帖文力撐，強調這正是她廿幾年來從未改變過金漆招牌。有擁躉直言欣賞她遇到難吃食物時敢於直說難吃，完全有別於其他旅遊節目主持逢迎買帳那種虛假感，認為她對待旅遊體驗那份直白與坦誠在娛樂圈中絕對是難能可貴。</p>\n<h2>兩極化網絡熱議反證《跟風旅行團》成功引發關注</h2>\n<p>整個網絡評論區目前呈現出極度喜好分明陣營，雖然有部分聲音覺得她與幕後工作人員互動略顯尷尬，甚至認為她對韓國與日本兩地感情無法相提並論，但依然無阻節目話題度直線飆升。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/26_50200066b066c8341b52.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"杜如風 跟風旅行團 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/26_50200066b066c8341b52.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179569339740892616_9508301426b081b55dbcf8.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"杜如風 跟風旅行團 （圖片來源：Threads截圖）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179569339740892616_9508301426b081b55dbcf8.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：Threads截圖）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179569339896434291_5011947276b081b5752d35.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"杜如風 跟風旅行團 （圖片來源：Threads截圖）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179569339896434291_5011947276b081b5752d35.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：Threads截圖）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179569340169447676_17024551916b081b5a1f3bf.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"杜如風 跟風旅行團 （圖片來源：Threads截圖）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179569340169447676_17024551916b081b5a1f3bf.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：Threads截圖）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/23_14619128846b066c7967890.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"杜如風 跟風旅行團 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/23_14619128846b066c7967890.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179501184846169866_70692076afdb508d07fe.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"杜如風 跟風旅行團 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179501184846169866_70692076afdb508d07fe.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/18_874253996afbe2c4bbd26.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"杜如風 跟風旅行團 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/18_874253996afbe2c4bbd26.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T12:03:53.501010+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1159,"images":7,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T11:43:29+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T13:57:28.289830+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T11:57:24.372335+00:00","content_hash":"b8f4011e101123f41a63e3ad3ad36b9fabd70222d74f4d44ae592cc08959b24d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}